ake it My Little Pony style.\n让它成为《我的小马驹》风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with bronze.\n让它呈现为青铜雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with rainbow candy and biscuits.\n让它呈现为彩虹糖果和饼干雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with tasty and delicious chocolate.\n让它呈现为美味巧克力雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with silver.\n让它呈现为银质雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with gold.\n让它呈现为金质雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with rusted iron.\n让它呈现为锈铁雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with glass.\n让它呈现为玻璃雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with bricks.\n让它呈现为砖块雕塑风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with ice.\n让它呈现为冰雕风格。\n\nMake it sculptured with slime.\n让它呈现为史莱姆（黏液）雕塑风格。\n\nTurn it into the 3D Chibi style.\n将其变为三维Q版风格。\n\nTurn it into the Fabric style.\n将其变为布艺风格。\n\nTurn it into the Ghibli style.\n将其变为吉卜力风格。\n\nTurn it into the Jojo style.\n将其变为《JOJO的奇妙冒险》风格。\n\nTurn it into the LEGO style.\n将其变为乐高积木风格。\n\nTurn it into the Paper Cutting style.\n将其变为剪纸风格。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [374.8702087402344, 698.39111328125], "pos": [284.158447265625, 136.08462524414062], "id": 5197, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Turn it into the real domain (for Sim2Real).\n将画面转换为真实领域（用于 Sim2Real）。\n\nMake the scene in fire.\n让场景充满火焰。\n\nMake it Steampunk style (mechanical with gears, pipes and brass details).\n让它成为蒸汽朋克风格（机械结构、齿轮、管道和黄铜细节）。\n\nMake it a Japanese anime style, cel shading video.\n让它成为日式动画风格的赛璐珞渲染视频。\n\nMake it a pencil sketch style video.\n让它成为铅笔素描风格的视频。\n\nMake it a Pixel Art video.\n让它成为像素艺术风格的视频。\n\nMake it a Claymation.\n让它成为黏土动画风格。\n\nMake it a Ukiyo-e style video.\n让它成为浮世绘风格的视频。\n\nMake it a Renaissance art style video.\n让它成为文艺复兴艺术风格的视频。\n\nMake it a drawing by Van Gogh.\n让它像梵高的画作一样。\n\nMake it Cyberpunk style (implants, futuristic).\n让它成为赛博朋克风格（带有义体植入和未来感）。\n\nMake it watercolor drawing style.\n让它成为水彩画风格。\n\nMake it Comic Book Style.\n让它成为漫画书风格。\n\nMake it Children's Book Illustration.\n让它成为儿童绘本插画风格。\n\nMake it a Charcoal Drawing.\n让它成为炭笔素描风格。\n\nMake it Rick and Morty style.\n让它成为《瑞克和莫蒂》风格。\n\nMake it Spirited Away style.\n让它成为《千与千寻》风格。\n\nMake it Moe style anime.\n让它成为萌系动漫风格。\n\nMake it Pixar style.\n让它成为皮克斯动画风格。\n\nMake it Golden Age Warner/Disney style.\n让它成为迪士尼/华纳黄金时代风格。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [370.26458740234375, 703.4464721679688], "pos": [-99.0377426147461, 131.57437133789062], "id": 5198, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["也可自己写提示词，样式按照上面的样式"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [776.218017578125, 147.8459930419922], "pos": [-100.4232406616211, 889.9200439453125], "id": 5199, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["我用夸克网盘给你分享了「ltx2.3视频编辑配套Lora」，点击链接或复制整段内容，打开「夸克APP」即可获取。\n/~b1cc3Ykz7O~:/\n链接：https://pan.quark.cn/s/3961531e5ec3"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1820.615966796875, 88], "pos": [1890.3768310546875, -805.38525390625], "id": 5147, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [13740], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "frame_count", "links": [13620], "label": "帧计数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [13621], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_info", "links": [13669], "label": "视频信息", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "localized_name": "video_info"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 0, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 81, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"custom_height": 0, "filename": "162e8334e66b3a9d3ec20fb4a371f06a981f29e0c3c08061a641d166f1559685.mp4", "force_rate": 0, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "f